IMPORT `dg-core`

-- Delaware General Corporation Law, 8 Del. C. ch. 1 -- piece dg5, layer 1.
-- Section 231 (voting procedures and inspectors of elections).
--
-- The source is the plain-text rendering de-code-t8-ch1-2026-10-01.txt of the Delaware Code Online (through 85 Del. Laws, c. 550).
-- It is not the official text. `-- src:N | ...` is line N of that file; an ellipsis means the line goes on.
--
-- Section 114(b)(2) takes section 231 out of the stockholder-to-member reading: it speaks of stockholders and stockholder meetings only.
-- The information the inspectors may use is fixed by sections 211(e), 211(a)(2)b. and 212(c)(2) (piece dg4); here it is a named kind of information.

§ `Section 231(e) -- whether the section applies to the corporation`

-- out of range: the Securities Exchange Act of 1934 (federal law, not among the inputs)
-- src:964 | (e) Unless otherwise provided in the certificate of incorporation or bylaws, this section shall not apply to a corporation that does not have a class of voting stock that is:
-- src:965 | (1) Listed on a national securities exchange;
-- src:966 | (2) Authorized for quotation on an interdealer quotation system of a registered national securities association; or
-- src:967 | (3) Held of record by more than 2,000 stockholders.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 231(e) (src:964-967)
DECLARE `dg5 s 231(e) Voting stock of the corporation` HAS
    `the corporation has a class of voting stock that is listed on a national securities exchange` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the corporation has a class of voting stock that is authorized for quotation on an interdealer quotation system of a registered national securities association` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the number of stockholders of record of the class of voting stock held of record by the most stockholders` IS A NUMBER
    `where a provision otherwise providing is made`        IS A `Where a provision is made`
    `that provision makes section 231 apply to the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN

-- "Held of record by more than 2,000 stockholders": strictly more than 2,000 (Fork F1). "Unless otherwise provided in the certificate of incorporation or bylaws": the provision
-- that displaces the exclusion makes the section apply; a resolution of the board does not.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 231(e) (src:964-967)
GIVEN v IS A `dg5 s 231(e) Voting stock of the corporation`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 231(e) section 231 applies to the corporation` v MEANS
        v's `the corporation has a class of voting stock that is listed on a national securities exchange`
     OR v's `the corporation has a class of voting stock that is authorized for quotation on an interdealer quotation system of a registered national securities association`
     OR v's `the number of stockholders of record of the class of voting stock held of record by the most stockholders` GREATER THAN 2000
     OR (    (   v's `where a provision otherwise providing is made` EQUALS `in the certificate of incorporation`
              OR v's `where a provision otherwise providing is made` EQUALS `in the bylaws`)
         AND v's `that provision makes section 231 apply to the corporation`)

§ `Section 231(a) -- appointing inspectors`

-- src:954 | (a) The corporation shall, in advance of any meeting of stockholders, appoint 1 or more inspectors to act at the meeting and make a written report thereof. The corporation may designate 1 or more persons as alternate inspectors to replace any inspector who fails to act. If no inspector or alternate is able to act at a meeting of stockholders, the person presiding at the meeting shall appoint 1 or more inspectors to act at the meeting. Each inspector, before entering upon the discharge of the duties of inspector, shall take and sign an oath faithfully to execute the duties of inspector with strict impartiality and according to the best of such inspector’s ability.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 231(a) (src:954)
DECLARE `dg5 s 231(a) Who appoints the inspectors` IS ONE OF
    `the corporation, in advance of the meeting of stockholders`
    `the person presiding at the meeting of stockholders`
    `no one, because section 231 does not apply to the corporation`

-- "If no inspector or alternate is able to act at a meeting of stockholders, the person presiding at the meeting shall appoint 1 or more inspectors."
@ref 8 Del. C. § 231(a) (src:954)
GIVEN `section 231 applies to the corporation` IS A BOOLEAN
      `no inspector or alternate is able to act at the meeting` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `dg5 s 231(a) Who appoints the inspectors`
`s 231(a) who must appoint the inspectors` `section 231 applies to the corporation` `no inspector or alternate is able to act at the meeting` MEANS
    IF NOT `section 231 applies to the corporation`
    THEN `no one, because section 231 does not apply to the corporation`
    ELSE IF `no inspector or alternate is able to act at the meeting`
         THEN `the person presiding at the meeting of stockholders`
         ELSE `the corporation, in advance of the meeting of stockholders`

-- src:954 | Each inspector, before entering upon the discharge of the duties of inspector, shall take and sign an oath faithfully to execute the duties of inspector with strict impartiality and according to the best of such inspector’s ability.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 231(a) (src:954)
GIVEN `the inspector took and signed an oath faithfully to execute the duties of inspector with strict impartiality and according to the best of the inspector's ability` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 231(a) the inspector may enter upon the discharge of the duties of inspector` `the inspector took and signed an oath faithfully to execute the duties of inspector with strict impartiality and according to the best of the inspector's ability` MEANS
    `the inspector took and signed an oath faithfully to execute the duties of inspector with strict impartiality and according to the best of the inspector's ability`

§ `Section 231(b) -- the inspectors' duties`

-- src:955 | (b) The inspectors shall:
-- src:956 | (1) Ascertain the number of shares outstanding and the voting power of each;
-- src:957 | (2) Determine the shares represented at a meeting and the validity of proxies and ballots;
-- src:958 | (3) Count all votes and ballots;
-- src:959 | (4) Determine and retain for a reasonable period a record of the disposition of any challenges made to any determination by the inspectors; and
-- src:960 | (5) Certify their determination of the number of shares represented at the meeting, and their count of all votes and ballots.
-- src:961 | The inspectors may appoint or retain other persons or entities to assist the inspectors in the performance of the duties of the inspectors.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 231(b) (src:955-961)
DECLARE `dg5 s 231(b) What the inspectors have done` HAS
    `they ascertained the number of shares outstanding and the voting power of each` IS A BOOLEAN
    `they determined the shares represented at the meeting and the validity of proxies and ballots` IS A BOOLEAN
    `they counted all votes and ballots`                                              IS A BOOLEAN
    `they determined and retained for a reasonable period a record of the disposition of any challenges made to any determination by them` IS A BOOLEAN
    `they certified their determination of the number of shares represented at the meeting and their count of all votes and ballots` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref 8 Del. C. § 231(b) (src:955-961)
GIVEN d IS A `dg5 s 231(b) What the inspectors have done`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 231(b) the inspectors have performed their duties` d MEANS
        d's `they ascertained the number of shares outstanding and the voting power of each`
    AND d's `they determined the shares represented at the meeting and the validity of proxies and ballots`
    AND d's `they counted all votes and ballots`
    AND d's `they determined and retained for a reasonable period a record of the disposition of any challenges made to any determination by them`
    AND d's `they certified their determination of the number of shares represented at the meeting and their count of all votes and ballots`

-- src:961 | The inspectors may appoint or retain other persons or entities to assist the inspectors in the performance of the duties of the inspectors.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 231(b) (src:961)
GIVEN `the inspectors are acting at a meeting to which section 231 applies` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 231(b) the inspectors may appoint or retain other persons or entities to assist them` `the inspectors are acting at a meeting to which section 231 applies` MEANS
    `the inspectors are acting at a meeting to which section 231 applies`

§ `Section 231(c) and (d) -- the polls, and what the inspectors may look at`

-- src:962 | (c) The date and time of the opening and the closing of the polls for each matter upon which the stockholders will vote at a meeting shall be announced at the meeting. No ballot, proxies or votes, nor any revocations thereof or changes thereto, shall be accepted by the inspectors after the closing of the polls unless the Court of Chancery upon application by a stockholder shall determine otherwise.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 231(c) (src:962)
GIVEN `the date and time of the opening and the closing of the polls for the matter were announced at the meeting` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 231(c) the announcement of the opening and the closing of the polls was made as the subsection requires` `the date and time of the opening and the closing of the polls for the matter were announced at the meeting` MEANS
    `the date and time of the opening and the closing of the polls for the matter were announced at the meeting`

-- "No ballot, proxies or votes, nor any revocations thereof or changes thereto, shall be accepted by the inspectors after the closing of the polls unless the Court of Chancery
-- upon application by a stockholder shall determine otherwise." The Court's determination is a conditional input.
-- src:962 | No ballot, proxies or votes, nor any revocations thereof or changes thereto, shall be accepted by the inspectors after the closing of the polls unless the Court of Chancery upon application by a stockholder shall determine otherwise.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 231(c) (src:962)
GIVEN `the ballot, proxy, vote, revocation or change was received after the closing of the polls` IS A BOOLEAN
      `the Court of Chancery upon application by a stockholder has determined otherwise` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 231(c) the inspectors may accept the ballot, proxy, vote, revocation or change` `the ballot, proxy, vote, revocation or change was received after the closing of the polls` `the Court of Chancery upon application by a stockholder has determined otherwise` MEANS
        (NOT `the ballot, proxy, vote, revocation or change was received after the closing of the polls`)
     OR `the Court of Chancery upon application by a stockholder has determined otherwise`

-- out of range: sections 211(e), 211(a)(2)b. and 212(c)(2) (piece dg4)
-- src:963 | (d) In determining the validity and counting of proxies and ballots, the inspectors shall be limited to an examination of the proxies, any envelopes submitted with those proxies, any information provided in accordance with § 211(e) or § 212(c)(2) of this title, or any information provided pursuant to § 211(a)(2)b.(i) or (iii) of this title, ballots and the regular books and records of the corporation, except that the inspectors may consider other reliable information for the limited purpose of reconciling proxies and ballots submitted by or on behalf of banks, brokers, their nominees or similar persons which represent more votes than the holder of a proxy is authorized by the record owner to cast or more votes than the stockholder holds of record. If the inspectors consider other reliable information for the limited purpose permitted herein, the inspectors at the time they make their certification pursuant to paragraph (b)(5) of this section shall specify the precise information considered by them including the person or persons from whom they obtained the information, when the information was obtained, the means by which the information was obtained and the basis for the inspectors’ belief that such information is accurate and reliable.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 231(d) (src:963)
DECLARE `dg5 s 231(d) Information the inspectors consider` IS ONE OF
    `the proxies the inspectors examine`
    `any envelopes submitted with the proxies`
    `information provided in accordance with section 211(e) or section 212(c)(2)`
    `information provided pursuant to section 211(a)(2)b.(i) or (iii)`
    `the ballots the inspectors examine`
    `the regular books and records of the corporation`
    `other reliable information the inspectors consider`

-- Everything on the list may be examined; other reliable information only "for the limited purpose of reconciling proxies and ballots submitted by or on behalf of banks, brokers,
-- their nominees or similar persons which represent more votes than the holder of a proxy is authorized by the record owner to cast or more votes than the stockholder holds of record".
@ref 8 Del. C. § 231(d) (src:963)
GIVEN i IS A `dg5 s 231(d) Information the inspectors consider`
      `the information is considered for the limited purpose of reconciling proxies and ballots that represent more votes than the proxy holder is authorized to cast or the stockholder holds of record` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 231(d) the inspectors may consider the information in determining the validity and counting of proxies and ballots` i `the information is considered for the limited purpose of reconciling proxies and ballots that represent more votes than the proxy holder is authorized to cast or the stockholder holds of record` MEANS
    CONSIDER i
    WHEN `other reliable information the inspectors consider` THEN `the information is considered for the limited purpose of reconciling proxies and ballots that represent more votes than the proxy holder is authorized to cast or the stockholder holds of record`
    OTHERWISE TRUE

-- src:963 | If the inspectors consider other reliable information for the limited purpose permitted herein, the inspectors at the time they make their certification pursuant to paragraph (b)(5) of this section shall specify the precise information considered by them including the person or persons from whom they obtained the information, when the information was obtained, the means by which the information was obtained and the basis for the inspectors’ belief that such information is accurate and reliable.
@ref 8 Del. C. § 231(d) (src:963)
DECLARE `dg5 s 231(d) Certification of other reliable information` HAS
    `the inspectors considered other reliable information for the limited purpose permitted` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the certification specifies the precise information considered`                         IS A BOOLEAN
    `the certification specifies the person or persons from whom the information was obtained` IS A BOOLEAN
    `the certification specifies when the information was obtained`                          IS A BOOLEAN
    `the certification specifies the means by which the information was obtained`            IS A BOOLEAN
    `the certification specifies the basis for the inspectors' belief that the information is accurate and reliable` IS A BOOLEAN

@ref 8 Del. C. § 231(d) (src:963)
GIVEN c IS A `dg5 s 231(d) Certification of other reliable information`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`s 231(d) the certification under paragraph (b)(5) specifies what it must` c MEANS
        (NOT c's `the inspectors considered other reliable information for the limited purpose permitted`)
     OR (    c's `the certification specifies the precise information considered`
         AND c's `the certification specifies the person or persons from whom the information was obtained`
         AND c's `the certification specifies when the information was obtained`
         AND c's `the certification specifies the means by which the information was obtained`
         AND c's `the certification specifies the basis for the inspectors' belief that the information is accurate and reliable`)
